  },
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why this happens",
      "char_file": "우유_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Many people with rhinitis notice",
        "sneezing and congestion flare up",
        "after certain meals",
        "",
        "Some foods raise histamine",
        "or inflammation in the body"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Dairy",
      "char_file": "우유_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Milk and cheese contain casein,",
        "a protein some research links",
        "to a thicker feel in mucus",
        "",
        "Many people feel more",
        "stuffed up after dairy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Dairy — the fix",
      "char_file": "우유_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Try oat or almond milk",
        "instead of dairy milk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Wine & Alcohol",
      "char_file": "와인_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Wine and other alcohol carry",
        "natural histamine and widen",
        "the blood vessels in your nose",
        "",
        "Even one drink can trigger",
        "sudden congestion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Alcohol — the fix",
      "char_file": "와인_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Pick a clear spirit like",
        "vodka soda over wine or beer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cured Meats & Aged Cheese",
      "char_file": "가공육_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Bacon, salami, and aged cheeses",
        "like cheddar are some of the",
        "highest-histamine foods around",
        "",
        "Eating a lot can make",
        "sneezing worse"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cured meats — the fix",
      "char_file": "가공육_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Swap for fresh turkey",
        "or chicken breast"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      [
        "Dairy, wine, and cured meats",
        "don't need to disappear for good"
      ],
      [
        "Small swaps in what you",
        "reach for can ease the reaction"
      ]
    ],
    "tip": [
      "If congestion lasts more than 2 weeks,",
      "an ENT visit is worth considering"
    ],
